{
 "name": "nat-fork-snapshot-selected-branch",
 "description": "native-host.ts:416 fork notes snapshot the selected branch without sharing its writable checkpoint: the child's private copy keeps the parent's mtime and leaves unrelated notes behind, the parent's listing collapses identical copies and lists diverged ones, a labeled live reference shows the parent's newer note, child appends stay private, and a resumed child keeps its copy.",
